    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to believe that \"setting it down\" is okay. it feels so heavy. like i'm just supposed to exist in this emptiness forever, dragging this version of myself around. there's no beauty in a closed book, just... nothingness. does it really just end like that? without any more struggle?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
